# Default test-skip patterns for pre-review-gates.sh
# Uses gitignore syntax: globs, ** recursion, ! negation
# Lines are evaluated in order — later rules override earlier ones
#
# Project overrides: .claude/pre-review.yml → test_skip_patterns section
# Override patterns are appended after these defaults (so they win)
#
# Three sibling keys live in that same .claude/pre-review.yml. They are
# DISTINCT claims — pick by what is actually true of the file, since each
# suppresses a different thing:
#
#   test_skip_patterns  this file needs no test of its own
#   test_patterns       this file IS a test (#568)
#   stdout_is_output    this file's print()/console.log IS the program's
#                       output, not a debug leftover — a CLI (#680).
#                       Suppresses ONLY the print family; breakpoint(), pdb,
#                       the `debugger` keyword, binding.pry and byebug keep
#                       firing, since none of those is ever program output.
#
# Example:
#
#   stdout_is_output:
#     - "scripts/*.py"
#     - "src/cli/**"

# --- Static assets and media ---
*.gitkeep
*.svg
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.ico
*.webp
*.woff
*.woff2
*.eot
*.ttf
*.otf
*.mp3
*.mp4
*.webm
*.pdf

# --- Stylesheets ---
*.css
*.scss
*.sass
*.less
*.styl

# --- Documentation and markup ---
*.md
*.mdx
*.txt
*.rst
*.adoc

# --- Data and config ---
*.json
*.yaml
*.yml
*.toml
*.ini
*.cfg
*.conf
*.env
*.env.*
*.xml
*.csv

# --- Lock files and checksums ---
*.lock
*lock.json
*go.sum
*-lock.yaml

# --- Shell scripts ---
# *.sh and *.bash are deliberately NOT skipped (#598). They were, on the premise
# that shell scripts have no tests — false in any repo whose test suites are
# themselves shell, and it made the scanner silent on the bulk of every diff.
# scan_missing_tests has an sh|bash discovery arm; see pre-review-gates.sh.
#
# *.zsh stays skipped because it has NO such arm: un-skipping it would route zsh
# to the unknown-extension MEDIUM branch, which is noise, not a finding.
*.zsh

# --- Build and project files ---
**/Dockerfile
**/Dockerfile.*
**/docker-compose*.yml
**/docker-compose*.yaml
**/.dockerignore
**/.gitignore
**/.gitattributes
**/.editorconfig
**/.prettierrc*
**/.eslintrc*
**/tsconfig*.json
**/Makefile
**/Rakefile
**/Gemfile
**/Procfile

# --- License and changelog ---
**/LICENSE*
**/LICENCE*
**/CHANGELOG*
**/CHANGES*
**/AUTHORS*

# --- Database migrations and schema (framework-managed) ---
**/migrations/*.py
**/migrations/*.rb
**/migrations/*.sql
db/schema.rb
db/seeds.rb
db/structure.sql

# --- Framework config directories ---
config/**/*.rb
config/**/*.yml
